WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.168 size:84% position:58%
[cheers and applause]

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.336 size:88% position:56%
[spooky music]

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.205
- In theaters this Halloween...

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:07.574 size:88% position:56%
[screeching]

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:12.012
Comes a new vision of horror
like you've never seen before.

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:17.617 align:start size:78% position:22%
From the twisted mind...

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:18.785 size:88% position:56%
of Wes Anderson...

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:20.387 size:88% position:56%
[upbeat music]

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:23.723 size:81% position:59%
It's "The Midnight Coterie
of Sinister Intruders,"

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:26.926 align:start size:72% position:28%
starring Owen Wilson
as a man in danger.

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:28.261 size:88% position:56%
- Wow.
What the heck?

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:32.165 size:88% position:56%
There's a bunch of crazy
people standing in our yard.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.300 size:84% position:58%
Hey, hon, I think we're
about to get murdered.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.903 size:84% position:58%
- And his terrified wife,
Gwyneth Paltrow.

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:38.571 size:88% position:56%
- You don't say.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.778 align:start size:78% position:22%
- Yeah, look at 'em all!

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:46.446 size:84% position:58%
There's a guy
with a meat cleaver

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:47.981 size:84% position:58%
and an old record player.

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:49.849 align:start size:78% position:22%
One's carrying a falcon.

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:52.218 size:84% position:58%
There are twins in
matching track suits.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:53.620 size:88% position:56%
Hey, look at that.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:55.789 size:84% position:58%
Why, that's Danny Glover.

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:58.224
- Hello.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.326 size:88% position:56%
- A tale of handmade horror.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:04.297 size:84% position:58%
[fast violin music]

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:07.867 size:81% position:59%
- Hey, they've sent us
some kind of communiqué!

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:09.335 align:start size:72% position:28%
- "Dear Homeowner...

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:10.670
"Can we kill you?

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.405
The Murderers."

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:13.807 size:88% position:56%
- "Dear Murderers,

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:14.941 size:88% position:56%
"No you may not!

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:16.409
The Homeowner."

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:22.248 size:84% position:58%
Hey, kids, come on, let's
go to the panic room!

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:30.824 size:81% position:59%
- We have to protect
ourselves, or we'll die.

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:33.293 size:84% position:58%
- Quick, let's gather
all our weapons.

00:01:42.869 --> 00:01:44.137
- Darn.

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:46.072 size:84% position:58%
- We should've left sooner.

00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:48.875 size:81% position:59%
- With Tilda Swinton
as the town constable.

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:52.712 size:81% position:59%
[knock at door]
- Hey, wow. We're saved.

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:55.348
- Who here are the murderers?

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:57.917
I see.

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:59.786 size:81% position:59%
- "The New York Times"
calls it,

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:02.255
"You Had Me at Wes Anderson."

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:06.459 size:84% position:58%
And "Fangoria" magazine
says, "Da Fuh?"

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:22.242 size:88% position:56%
And Alec Baldwin
as the Narrator.

00:02:26.112 --> 00:02:27.547
[thunder booms]

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:29.415 align:start size:72% position:28%
[bicycle bell rings]

